{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-44","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-44-talk-403815132-line","text":"一个悲悼伶人骑着银河巨象，缓步步入你的视线…她不知为何仍在哭泣。接着，她从银河巨象走了下来，她祈愿为你展现一场「不收费」的奇妙伶人戏法。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-44-talk-403815134-line","text":"你已完全跟不上了…瞎蒙一个吧！","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-44-text-16559207465667919956-choice","text":"你还可以将杯子砸了！","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-44-text-3926655457891528209-choice","text":"选择左边的杯子。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-44-text-8936011334129494401-choice","text":"选择右边的杯子。","speaker":""}]}
